umac-pyrowave-decode reimplements the PyroWave decoder (bitstream v1). The compute shaders in
src/shaders/dequant.wgsl and src/shaders/idwt.wgsl are ports of PyroWave's
shaders/wavelet_dequant.comp, shaders/idwt.comp and shaders/dwt_common.h
(https://github.com/Themaister/pyrowave, commit 7fe0e2667cd3076b8b2bf04bcb80bc8d691b800b).
The test vectors in testdata/ were produced with PyroWave's Metal encoder and decoder.

